        "altsectionlayouttwthree": "text-image",
        "nopadding": false,
        "altthreeimage": "shopify://shop_images/2-MTK-Section-Carefully-Selected-Factories_1080x1080_42a6272c-3603-470d-a9de-bfd16c4f48ea.webp",
        "altheadingclthree": "Audited partner factories",
        "h2maxwidthdesktop": 300,
        "h2maxwidthmobile": 300,
        "altbodyclthree": "<p>Even in factories, all of our detailing is done by hand. We work only with audited factories that share the same values as us: female-founded, family run, and small team focused. That includes a 40 hour working week, fair wages, 100% safe working conditions, healthcare benefits, paid maternity leave and paid sick leave. Stuff we might take for granted but rarely exists in the garment industry.<br/></p>",
        "pmaxwidthdesktop": 900,
        "pmaxwidthmobile": 300,
        "padding_sizeup": 21,
        "padding_sizedown": 12,
        "padding_sizeupm": 7,
        "padding_sizedownm": 15,
        "padding_sizeupm_section": 27,
        "padding_sizedownm_section": 0,
        "sectionID": "section-4"
      }
    },
    "1644876171ff86ce90": {
      "type": "static-two-column-alt3",
      "settings": {
        "borderlayouttwoclthreealt": "top-bottom",
        "altsectionlayouttwthree": "image-text",
        "nopadding": false,
        "altthreeimage": "shopify://shop_images/3-MTK-Section-Careers-not-jobs_1080x1080_b62bb85f-b404-42ef-9b6a-b6b960eafadd.webp",
        "altheadingclthree": "Careers not jobs",
        "h2maxwidthdesktop": 300,
        "h2maxwidthmobile": 300,
        "altbodyclthree": "<p>As we grow as a business, so do our knitters. We train our knitters on things like Excel and project management: skills they can take to their future jobs. Often, our knitters will grow upwards at The Knotty Ones, like Marina, our first ever knitter who now works as our Head of Production, managing over 70 knitters. Our wish is to empower women in rural areas by helping them to become more financially independent: we encourage them to dream and we help make these dreams come true. </p>",
        "pmaxwidthdesktop": 900,
        "pmaxwidthmobile": 300,
